  "authority": "Typed-source inspection/composition only; no new native analysis or execution.",
  "production_dependency": "require_loader_attach_runtime: real native configuration/console assembly and concrete initial application-Domain policy inputs.",
  "implementation": [
    "install_native_configuration_console selects actual native-key Configuration, path/encoding/persistence/SDK and CompilerConsole providers with the image-managed stream. Uses existing checked installation and empty initial path binding; construction reads no configuration or console state.",
    "make_scalar_documents owns a real file Factory (NativeFactory by default), reads raw bytes with03b3f0, uses existing grammar and full selected Config2 hash-copy source, and returns owning Node storage. Existing scalar-application guard refuses ordered collection consumers whose subsequent reused-copy semantics belong to Runtime FilePass. No fake successful/unreachable reader is installed.",
    "Runtime FilePass remains the complete file/parser/reused hash-copy application route, bypassing legacy load_document. The new legacy scalar reader does not replace or restrict that actual startup path.",
    "make_native_initial_policy reuses recovered04c134 cookie arithmetic with native FILETIME/thread/process/QPC and real local source stack identity. It returns explicit source new_mode0/null-handler/thread_policy0 choices, not inferred PE defaults. Compiler CRT/security cookie is untouched; no Domain/FLS/heap initialization occurs. Caller can pass this policy to existing InitialInputs/make_initial_domain/initialize.",
    "Native QPC false has no proven written observation, so the adapter reports unavailable output and existing UninitializedCounterDomain rather than reading indeterminate storage or inventing zero. Successful native/injected outputs must obey Win32 contracts; failure projection is not exact original uninitialized-stack behavior."
  ],
  "scenarios_added": "Scalar real file/parser/hash source cases cover BOM/completed duplicate, fresh parse errors, missing Config2/owned result and ordered collection refusal. Native base case inspects actual provider types, LastError and replacement retention. Domain entropy source cases inspect complete imports, source-policy/cookie shape and failed-QPC/no-Domain prefix. None compiled/executed.",
  "scope_limits": [
    "No original MSVC class/EH/CRT ABI or native loader equivalence claimed by these source adapters.",
    "Domain root creation/initialize and both base/Worker selectors still must be wired into a real per-image owner.",
    "Actual host/callback and Online lifetime assembly plus require_loader_attach_runtime definition remain open. Detach remains source-defined, uncompiled."
  ],
